## Colliding

---


[__Bi-entity Condition Type__](https://eggolib.github.io/latest/types/bientity_condition_types/colliding)

Checks if the actor entity is colliding with the target entity.

Type ID: eggolib:colliding

---

### Examples

=== "Example #1"

    ```json
    "bientity_condition": {
        "type": "eggolib:colliding"
    }
    ```


=== "Example #2"

    ```json
    "bientity_condition": {
        "type": "apoli:or",
        "conditions": [
            {
                "type": "eggolib:colliding",
                "offset": {
                    "x": 0.5,
                    "y": 0.0,
                    "z": 0.5
                }
            },
            {
                "type": "eggolib:colliding",
                "offset": {
                    "x": -0.5,
                    "y": 0.0,
                    "z": -0.5
                }
            }
        ]
    }
    ```



